<title>JAPAN: Tohoku Misawa - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tohoku Misawa - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 23.57		vs	   22.30</p>
<p> Operating	    1.16		vs	    1.17</p>
<p> Current		1.20		vs	    1.19</p>
